id: pm-slack-7fwr
title: "Daily release fails its own release:check: the release regenerates CHANGELOG.md without --include-empty"
description: "The release step Generate changelog and release notes rendered CHANGELOG.md without --include-empty, but changelog:check (run by release:check) renders with it. The release therefore dropped the empty tag sections the check expects, and every daily release since the pm-changelog 2026.11.6 bump failed at Run release checks with 'Changelog is out of date' (reproduced on 2026-11-10 run logs)."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[4]: changelog,ci,"gh:unbraind/pm-slack#188",release
created_at: "2026-11-10T15:56:19.583Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-11T17:40:50.708Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: "The release generates CHANGELOG.md with exactly the section-selection flags changelog:check verifies; A contract test fails when the two drift apart again, and fails on revert"
actual_result: "Run release checks: Changelog is out of date; the generated file lacks 'No changes.' sections for older tags."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-10T15:56:42.117Z",claude-orchestrator,"Fix: --include-empty added to the release's CHANGELOG.md generation, matching changelog:check. A new contract test in test/release-workflow.test.ts compares the flags. Revert proof: with the workflow change reverted the test fails, and with it the test passes. pm-slack: typecheck clean, full npm test 1021 pass / 0 fail; new contract test 1/0 with the fix, 0/1 without it."
  "2026-11-10T17:20:03.601Z",claude-orchestrator,"CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOSYpJkM61zBVh: the contract test now also requires at least one real writer (a pm-changelog CHANGELOG.md invocation without --check). A paired --check alone would have satisfied the filter. Revert proof: making every writer line a --check fails the test (0/1); unchanged 1/0."
  "2026-11-10T21:32:57.700Z",claude-orchestrator,"Review round: the contract test now selects every pm-changelog writer and inline check in the generate step independently of mode and output, excluding only the --stdout notes call (CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOSYpJkM6101sM). A check pointed at another file without --include-empty fails it. The post-tag empty Unreleased section (PRRT_kwDOSYpJkM6101sH) is pre-existing pm-changelog behaviour and is filed as unbraind/pm-changelog issue 337."
  "2026-11-11T17:30:56.773Z",codex-smallfix3-1111,"Read four review threads with all comments; two remain unresolved. Blocking pre-tag versus post-tag mismatch is present in the pinned generator. Will preserve the same include-empty flags and validate a generation, commit, tag, check transaction in a disposable repository. Argument contracts will preserve PM argument order."
  "2026-11-11T17:40:49.693Z",codex-smallfix3-1111,"Fixed both unresolved threads. A narrow pinned-generator wrapper preserves the empty Unreleased section before tagging without changing release sections or dropping include-empty. The real temp repository contract generates, commits, tags and checks the same flags, and independently passes the unwrapped upstream post-tag check; stale output still refuses. Ordered PM argument regression rejects swapped option/value pairs. Scoped PM-linked suite passes 12/12, zero skipped; typecheck, build:test, docstring (27 files, 126 declarations) and release date verification pass. Disposable reverts of normalization and argument ordering each fail with AssertionError and exit 1; restored linked suite passes 12/12. This repo has no lint script or installed ESLint binary; no lint pass is claimed."
files[5]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project
  package.json,project
  scripts/pm-changelog.ts,project
  test/release-changelog-contract.test.ts,project
  test/release-workflow.test.ts,project
tests[2]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/release-workflow.test.ts,project,claude-orchestrator,"2026-11-10T15:56:37.185Z",local_mutation,fix/release-changelog-include-empty
  node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-workflow.test.ts test/release-changelog-contract.test.ts,project,codex-smallfix3-1111,"2026-11-11T17:38:35.354Z",local_mutation,fix/release-changelog-include-empty
body: ""
